{"id":"0fdc06d93e560f03","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-color-inheritance.md","title":"全黑／全白性质对子函数树保持","display":"lem-color-inheritance — 全黑／全白性质对子函数树保持","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-color-inheritance","aliases":["20-lem-color-inheritance"],"display":"lem-color-inheritance — 全黑／全白性质对子函数树保持","chapter":"12","section":"12.2–12.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"黑白树引理在嵌套构造中的保持条件","source_printed_pages":[199,200,201],"source_pdf_pages":[229,230,231],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-splitting]]","[[20-df-on-function-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-color-inheritance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-color-inheritance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-color-inheritance — 全黑／全白性质对子函数树保持"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.2–12.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"黑白树引理在嵌套构造中的保持条件"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>199</span><span>200</span><span>201</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span><span>230</span><span>231</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\">\\(S,T\\)</span> 都是全可计算函数树且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq_f T\">\\(S\\subseteq_f T\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}color-inheritance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{EBlack}(S,e),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{EWhite}(S,e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}color-inheritance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{EBlack}(S,e),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{EWhite}(S,e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>黑性只需值域包含。白性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的两兄弟节点不相容，作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的值，其域串也不相容；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 域中取最长共同前缀。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的这次白分裂的两个有限输出，经 oracle 延伸单调性传到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 两兄弟，故它们仍 e-分裂。不能仅凭“两个节点都在白树内”省略该共同祖先论证。</p>\n<p>来源：黑白树引理在嵌套构造中的保持条件；印刷页 199, 200, 201；PDF 第 229, 230, 231 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-on-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq_f T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}color-inheritance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{EBlack}(S,e),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{EWhite}(S,e).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1497,"backlinks":[{"id":"cb6a5dd98b8b185b","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-restriction]]；see [[20-lem-splitting-totality]]；see [[20-lem-color-inheritance]]。"}],"outgoing":["5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","37dcefa1c874faab"]}